        "expression": "let q = p * geometry_scale;\nlet r = length(q);\nlet a = atan2(q.y, q.x);\nlet warp = 0.25 * sin(r * 3.0 - t * 0.25 * pulse);\nlet spokes = abs(sin(a * 6.0 + warp));\nlet rings = abs(sin(r * 8.0 - t * 0.35 * pulse + 0.5 * sin(a * 6.0)));\nlet lines = max(1.0 - smoothstep(0.03, 0.12, spokes), 1.0 - smoothstep(0.04, 0.14, rings));\nlet facets = 0.5 + 0.5 * cos(a * 6.0 + r * 5.0 - t * 0.2 * pulse);\nlet base = mix(c1, c2, 0.5 + 0.5 * sin(r * 2.5 - t * 0.12 * pulse));\nlet accent = mix(c3, c4, facets);\nlet color = clamp(base * 0.55 + accent * (0.14 + 0.25 * lines), vec3<f32>(0.0), vec3<f32>(1.0));\nreturn mix(bg, color, strength);",
        "name": "Hypnotic Lattice",
